    "body": "### Motivation\n\nAdd an explicit explanation of the NOVA classification (or Ultra-processed levels) accessible from Compare mode to help users interpret the labels.\n\n### Proposed solution\n\nAdd a small info tooltip or help link next to the NOVA/Ultra-processed label that provides a concise explanation and links to longer documentation if needed.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Explanation is available from the Compare UI.\n- [ ] Tooltip text is concise and accessible.\n- [ ] Link to documentation provided when appropriate.\n\n### Design / mockup\n\n_No response_\n\n### Alternatives considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\nParent: #1557",
